Evidence files in this repository are released under CC BY 4.0.

The reference transcripts inside eval/SUMMARY_full_v2base.json and
eval/SUMMARY_full_v3pruned.json are derived from the Google FLEURS dataset
(CC BY 4.0), https://huggingface.co/datasets/google/fleurs. No FLEURS audio is
redistributed here.

Attribution:
  FLEURS: Google Research, https://huggingface.co/datasets/google/fleurs  (CC BY 4.0)
  iTantra evidence, Smart India Hackathon 2026, problem statement SIH26173,
  team B.J.P (Bug Janta Party).

These are measurement outputs. The recognition and speech models themselves are
NOT distributed here and are not covered by this licence.
